ClamAV Suite __SUITE_VERSION__

Bundles unmodified Cisco-Talos ClamAV __CLAMAV_VER__
  https://github.com/__CLAMAV_REPO__/releases/tag/__CLAMAV_TAG__

Bundles ArsenTech ClamAV GUI __GUI_VER__ (GPL-3.0), arm64 build, taken as
released and modified as follows. No executable code is altered.
  1. The application binary is renamed and a small compiled launcher is
     installed as the bundle's main executable, which prepends
     __CLAMAV_DIR__/bin to PATH and execs it. Without this the app cannot
     find clamscan, because launchd does not put that directory on PATH.
     The launcher's source is templates/launcher.c in the repository below.
  2. The bundle is re-signed with a Developer ID Application certificate.

  Upstream source: https://github.com/__GUI_REPO__/releases/tag/__GUI_TAG__
  The exact modifications are performed by, and documented in,
  mdm/clamav/build-clamav-suite.sh in pelotech/compliance-tools.
